# Asterisk VoIP skills — always on

Before any Asterisk / VoIP / PBX / IVR / dialplan / AGI / AMI / Call File / ARI / channel / Originate work in this repository:

1. Read and follow `.cursor/skills/asterisk-voip-stack/SKILL.md`
2. Read the matching domain skill before coding:
   - Dialplan / extensions.conf → `asterisk-dialplan`
   - AGI / FastAGI → `asterisk-agi`
   - AMI / Manager / Originate events → `asterisk-ami`
   - Call File / spool / outgoing → `asterisk-callfile`
3. Map implementations to `Ntk.AsterNet.AMI` (AMI + FastAGI) or `Ntk.AsterNet.ARI` as appropriate.
4. Canonical tutorials: `karavi/karavi.doc/Learn/voiping_*.pdf`

Do not implement VoIP behavior from memory alone when these skills apply.
